+  "evidence_assessment": "Evidence custody is careful and the two rejected runs are honestly reported.\n\nAccepted run: `.logs/d110c-0c1f5b-red-cecde972/` classifies itself `ACCEPTED_CAUSAL_RED_PENDING_REVIEW` with executionCount 1, runnerStatus 1, 2 selected tests in 1 file, 1 failed / 1 passed, 0 skipped, 0 todo, empty `topLevelErrors`, empty `additionalSoftFailures`, one failure message total and empty metadata on both assertions. `commands.json` records a single `vitest run` invocation from the signed, pushed tests commit `cecde972` on base `aea679ba`, with `productionEdits: 0`, `planEdits: 0`, `longRuns: 0`, 27 stashes preserved, and it honestly flags two diagnostic `rg` command errors as command errors rather than test executions. The result carries an explicit warning that post-causal continuations did not execute and no GREEN or golden-path claim is made.\n\nRejected runs are correctly distinguished. `1dcff170` (`REJECTED_MATRIX`) is 2 failed / 0 passed: the intended settlement token plus a v1 control that failed on `authority-unavailable: creator successor already has a conflicting active owner` — its assessment names the exact realm collision at creator-adoption-activate.ts:73/:360-364 and records that `D110C_FLOOR_MISMATCH` was NOT runtime-observed. `8fcbc039` (`REJECTED_MATRIX_STOPPED_NO_RERUN`) is also 2 failed / 0 passed, with the v1 control failing on `DurableIssuanceTypeError: page limit is outside the closed range` at browser-issuance-store.ts:1210 because the helper requested 256 against the product maximum of 128; the assessment names the correct fix (page with 128 and the cursor) and explicitly refuses to raise the product ceiling. Both are labelled REJECTED, both record that the stop rule fired, and both preserve the prior review union (Sol FAIL with two P1s, Fable xhigh PASS with three P2s, Grok `NO_VERDICT_TIMEOUT` treated as neither finding nor approval). The earlier `0c59869a` rejection is likewise recorded inside `3a9e9329/assessment.md`.\